  "solution": {
    "text": "The rise in temperature of neutralization reaction will be maximum for maximum number of moles of strong acid and strong base neutralized and lower volume of final solution.\n(3) $\\mathrm{HCl}+\\mathrm{NaOH} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{NaCl}+\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}$\nmmol $30 \\quad 30$\nFinal volume of solution $=60 \\mathrm{~mL}$\nOption (1) and (2) have weak acids and in option\n(4) only 20 mmol of HCl will be neutralized with 70 mL final volume.",
